OL,3,GNEWSASacked Grand Theft Auto workers
OL,4,Aprotest as company bosses quizzed at
OL,5,Atribunal
OL,6,
OL,7,FA group of workers sacked by gaming
OL,8,Fgiant Rockstar have held a protest
OL,9,Foutside an employment tribunal as
OL,10,Fcompany bosses are quizzed for a second
OL,11,Fday.
OL,13,FThe case centres on the dismissal
OL,14,Falmost a year ago of 34 workers, most
OL,15,Fof them based in Edinburgh, who claim
OL,16,Fthey were unfairly sacked for trade
OL,17,Funion activity.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
