OL,3,GNEWSASacked Grand Theft Auto workers
OL,4,Aprotest as company bosses quizzed at
OL,5,Atribunal
OL,6,
OL,7,FRockstar, which is due to launch Grand
OL,8,FTheft Auto 6 next month, maintains they
OL,9,Fwere dismissed for "sharing
OL,10,Fconfidential company information" in an
OL,11,Finsecure private online forum.
OL,13,FWorkers outside the tribunal building
OL,14,Fin Glasgow held signs calling for fired
OL,15,Fworkers to be reinstated.
